{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type CreateMutationResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult, TState> = BaseMutationNarrowing<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> & MapToSignals<OmitKeyof<TState, keyof BaseMutationNarrowing, \"safely\">>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts#L423","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts:423"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"injectMutation"},{"type":"text","value":". Based on "},{"type":"link","href":"CreateBaseMutationResult.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CreateBaseMutationResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":", but value fields are exposed as\na "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Signal"},{"type":"text","value":" — read them with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutation.data()"},{"type":"text","value":", not "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutation.data"},{"type":"text","value":" — while function fields ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutate"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutateAsync"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"reset"},{"type":"text","value":") are called directly, unchanged. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isSuccess"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isError"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isPending"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isIdle"},{"type":"text","value":" are\n"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/BaseMutationNarrowing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"BaseMutationNarrowing"}]},{"type":"text","value":" type-guard methods rather than plain booleans."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type your mutation function resolves to."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of errors your mutation function may throw."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvariables","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TVariables"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of the variable passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutate"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutateAsync"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tonmutateresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TOnMutateResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutate"},{"type":"text","value":", passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSuccess"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onError"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSettled"},{"type":"text","value":" as\ntheir "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":" parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tstate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TState"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TState"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CreateStatusBasedMutationResult"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"CreateBaseMutationResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CreateBaseMutationResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":"["},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"status\""},{"type":"text","value":"], "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TVariables"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TOnMutateResult"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tvariables","text":"TVariables","level":3},{"id":"tonmutateresult","text":"TOnMutateResult","level":3},{"id":"tstate","text":"TState","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype CreateMutationResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult, TState> = BaseMutationNarrowing<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> & MapToSignals<OmitKeyof<TState, keyof BaseMutationNarrowing, \"safely\">>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts:423](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts#L423)\n\nThe result of `injectMutation`. Based on [CreateBaseMutationResult](CreateBaseMutationResult.md), but value fields are exposed as\na `Signal` — read them with `mutation.data()`, not `mutation.data` — while function fields (`mutate`,\n`mutateAsync`, `reset`) are called directly, unchanged. `isSuccess`/`isError`/`isPending`/`isIdle` are\n[BaseMutationNarrowing](../interfaces/BaseMutationNarrowing.md) type-guard methods rather than plain booleans.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your mutation function resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your mutation function may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `unknown`\n\nThe type of the variable passed to `mutate`/`mutateAsync`.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled` as\ntheir `onMutateResult` parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data.\n\n### TState\n\n`TState` = `CreateStatusBasedMutationResult`\\<[`CreateBaseMutationResult`](CreateBaseMutationResult.md)\\[`\"status\"`\\], `TData`, `TError`, `TVariables`, `TOnMutateResult`\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: CreateMutationResult\ntitle: CreateMutationResult\n---\n\n```ts\ntype CreateMutationResult<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult, TState> = BaseMutationNarrowing<TData, TError, TVariables, TOnMutateResult> & MapToSignals<OmitKeyof<TState, keyof BaseMutationNarrowing, \"safely\">>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts:423](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/types.ts#L423)\n\nThe result of `injectMutation`. Based on [CreateBaseMutationResult](CreateBaseMutationResult.md), but value fields are exposed as\na `Signal` — read them with `mutation.data()`, not `mutation.data` — while function fields (`mutate`,\n`mutateAsync`, `reset`) are called directly, unchanged. `isSuccess`/`isError`/`isPending`/`isIdle` are\n[BaseMutationNarrowing](../interfaces/BaseMutationNarrowing.md) type-guard methods rather than plain booleans.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type your mutation function resolves to.\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors your mutation function may throw.\n\n### TVariables\n\n`TVariables` = `unknown`\n\nThe type of the variable passed to `mutate`/`mutateAsync`.\n\n### TOnMutateResult\n\n`TOnMutateResult` = `unknown`\n\nThe type returned by `onMutate`, passed to `onSuccess`/`onError`/`onSettled` as\ntheir `onMutateResult` parameter — useful for optimistic-update rollback data.\n\n### TState\n\n`TState` = `CreateStatusBasedMutationResult`\\<[`CreateBaseMutationResult`](CreateBaseMutationResult.md)\\[`\"status\"`\\], `TData`, `TError`, `TVariables`, `TOnMutateResult`\\>\n"}
